  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/onsir/Trigonella_foenum_graecum_SeedlingSurvival_BelowLD50Dose">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <owl:equivalentClass rdf:nodeID="N7d913226fac94438931e9752115b351d"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/onsir/BelowReportedLD50"/>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A dose assessment of Trigonella foenum-graecum for seedling survival in the early seedling stage, at a dose of 350 Gy or less; at 350 Gy, the highest dose of Patel et al. (2017), 56 % of seedlings survived.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <dct:source>Patel et al. 2017, J. AgriSearch 4(4):237-241, doi:10.21921/jas.v4i04.10200</dct:source>
    <onsir:boundQualifier>The source states that the LD50 is close to 350 Gy, its highest dose, at which 64 % of seeds germinated and 56 % of seedlings survived, against 96 % and 90 % in the control. Survival above half at 350 Gy makes 350 Gy a lower bound on the LD50, so only the window below the LD50 is defined, and it includes 350 Gy.</onsir:boundQualifier>
    <onsir:sourceStatement>The LD50 was closed to 350 on which 64 percent seed germination, 56% seedlings survival and a considerable reduction in seedlings growth were recorded.</onsir:sourceStatement>
    <skos:scopeNote>The source irradiated doses from 150 to 350 Gy and scored plants alive 30 days after sowing in Petri dishes, as a percentage of the seeds sown; where the window extends past the tested doses, the position is arithmetic only.</skos:scopeNote>
    <skos:definition>A dose assessment of Trigonella foenum-graecum for seedling survival in the early seedling stage, at a dose of 350 Gy or less; at 350 Gy, the highest dose of Patel et al. (2017), 56 % of seedlings survived.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Trigonella foenum-graecum seedling survival below LD50 dose</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/onsir/Nicotiana_tabacum_SeedlingPerformance_CotyledonFreeing_GerminationStage_BandUpperEndProbe">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <owl:equivalentClass rdf:nodeID="Na38ef5fe92ba4cbc865d0c3b07dd7f1b"/>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A dose assessment of Nicotiana tabacum for cotyledon freeing at the germination stage, at the upper end of the favourable band reported for that taxon, 15 Gy. The class is unsatisfiable when that dose also lies at or above an LD50 reported for the same taxon, endpoint and stage, which flags a band that reaches its LD50 for a curator.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <rdfs:comment>A probe for the reasoner, one for each endpoint and stage of a favourable band: it is satisfiable while the band lies below every LD50 reported for the same taxon, endpoint and stage.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition>A dose assessment of Nicotiana tabacum for cotyledon freeing at the germination stage, at the upper end of the favourable band reported for that taxon, 15 Gy. The class is unsatisfiable when that dose also lies at or above an LD50 reported for the same taxon, endpoint and stage, which flags a band that reaches its LD50 for a curator.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Nicotiana tabacum seedling performance cotyledon freeing germination stage band upper end probe</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
