  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/onsir/boundQualifier">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"/>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>How the source of a dose window supports the bound of the window: an approximate band end, a regression estimate, one estimate per genotype or setting, a bracket the source states, a bracket set by the source's observations or a lower bound at the highest dose tested.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <skos:definition>How the source of a dose window supports the bound of the window: an approximate band end, a regression estimate, one estimate per genotype or setting, a bracket the source states, a bracket set by the source's observations or a lower bound at the highest dose tested.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">bound qualifier</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
