    <obo:IAO_0000115>A bulb: a short underground shoot whose fleshy leaves or leaf bases store reserves, as in onion, shallot and tuberose. A garlic clove is a bulblet.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <obo:IAO_0000119>Plant Ontology (Cooper et al. 2013), checked on the EBI Ontology Lookup Service, PO:0025356 bulb</obo:IAO_0000119>
    <skos:definition>A bulb: a short underground shoot whose fleshy leaves or leaf bases store reserves, as in onion, shallot and tuberose. A garlic clove is a bulblet.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">plant bulb</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
