    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/onsir/DoseAssessment"/>
    <skos:definition>A dose assessment whose dose is below the LD50 reported for its taxon, endpoint and stage: below the reported estimate, below every estimate where the source reports one per genotype or setting, or at most a dose that the source's own observations place below the LD50.</skos:definition>
