    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:comment>In the OnSIR ABox one treatment individual records the irradiations of one study: a study that irradiated several doses carries a DoseRange from its lowest to its highest dose, and a treatment at a single dose records that dose with hasDose.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">seed irradiation treatment</rdfs:label>
    <skos:broadMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PECO_0007151"/>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A planned process in which seeds or other plant propagules (bulbs, tubers, cuttings, shoot cultures, callus) are exposed to radiation of a stated type and source, at a stated dose or dose range and, where reported, a stated dose rate.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <skos:definition>A planned process in which seeds or other plant propagules (bulbs, tubers, cuttings, shoot cultures, callus) are exposed to radiation of a stated type and source, at a stated dose or dose range and, where reported, a stated dose rate.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
