  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/onsir/Nicotiana_tabacum_SeedlingPerformance_FreshMass_EarlySeedlingStage_BandUpperEndProbe">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <owl:equivalentClass rdf:nodeID="N5bd5f6c8048e4e189f5cb2858aa92e1e"/>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A dose assessment of Nicotiana tabacum for fresh mass at the early seedling stage, at the upper end of the favourable band reported for that taxon, 15 Gy. The class is unsatisfiable when that dose also lies at or above an LD50 reported for the same taxon, endpoint and stage, which flags a band that reaches its LD50 for a curator.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <rdfs:comment>A probe for the reasoner, one for each endpoint and stage of a favourable band: it is satisfiable while the band lies below every LD50 reported for the same taxon, endpoint and stage.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition>A dose assessment of Nicotiana tabacum for fresh mass at the early seedling stage, at the upper end of the favourable band reported for that taxon, 15 Gy. The class is unsatisfiable when that dose also lies at or above an LD50 reported for the same taxon, endpoint and stage, which flags a band that reaches its LD50 for a curator.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Nicotiana tabacum seedling performance fresh mass early seedling stage band upper end probe</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
