  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/onsir/EarlySeedlingStage">
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">early seedling stage</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/onsir/LifecycleStage"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0007131"/>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The stage from seedling emergence through the first weeks of growth, over which seedling survival and growth are scored, in the studies coded here from 7 days to about six weeks after sowing.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <rdfs:comment>Matched to PO:0007131 seedling development stage by skos:closeMatch: the Plant Ontology seedling stage ends with the first true leaf, and radiosensitivity tests also score seedlings after it.</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition>The stage from seedling emergence through the first weeks of growth, over which seedling survival and growth are scored, in the studies coded here from 7 days to about six weeks after sowing.</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
